			"Message": "style(Worker): Reformat ESBuild configuration files with consistent indentation\n\nNormalize whitespace across three ESBuild configuration files, converting tab-based indentation to consistent space-based indentation throughout Target.js and both Worker.js files.\n\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Target.js`: switch from tabs to 2-space indentation, collapse __name helper to a single line\n- `Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`: switch from tabs to 2-space indentation, condense On/Clean const declarations\n- `Source/Configuration/ESBuild/Worker.js`: switch from tabs to 4-space indentation, condense On const declaration, reflow catch block braces\n\nZero functional changes — build output is identical.",
